    "current_example": {
      "math_academy_id": "e-2547",
      "problem": "What is the measure of the line segment $\\overline{ML}$ shown below?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14150837/assets/5956f2c41cb04f89e72602ec69ab76e729a3c031bd307f31bbcc24c7f12744ba.png)",
      "worked_solution": "Note that the length of a side of one cell is \n\n$$\n\\dfrac{10\\,\\textrm{mm}}{2} = 5\\,\\textrm{mm}.\n$$\n\nThe line segment has a length of $7$ cells, so the total measure is \n\n$$\nML = 7 \\cdot 5\\,\\textrm{mm} = 35\\,\\textrm{mm}.\n$$",
